	(gr_text "PMI-50 (J2 odd/even): 13/14 GND/GND; 15/16 GND/GND; 17/18 HS0_P/HS2_P; 19/20 HS0_N/HS2_N; 21/22 GND/GND; 23/24 HS1_P/HS3_P; 25/26 HS1_N/HS3_N; 27/28 GND/GND; 29/30 USB2_DP/SBU1; 31/32 USB2_DN/SBU2; 33/34 GND/GND; 35/36 CC1/HPD; 37/38 CC2/UTIL; 39/40 GND/GND; 41/42 ID_SCL/ID_SDA; 43/44 3V3_MOD/PRSNT#; 45/46 LED#/GND; 47/48 GND/GND; 49/50 GND/GND"
